{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id344686166"}, "name":{"label":"golden4ce"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-06-07T09:48:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.9"}, "id":{"label":"7437911721"}, "title":{"label":"Bug"}, "content":{"label":"There’s a bug where holding down on a task to complete it will not complete. I have to hold down on it again. This happens with all tasks where I have to hold twice to complete them.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id43336895"}, "name":{"label":"Macdara"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-05-23T10:45:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.8"}, "id":{"label":"7379189091"}, "title":{"label":"It works!"}, "content":{"label":"This App has evolved so much over the last couple of years since I last used it.\n\nThey’ve done amazing iOS integrations and made everything super slick.\n\nLooking forward to going on my health and wellness journey after 3 years since I picked up and injury and just lost focus between raising our young kids and changing jobs everything just went out the window.\n\nStreaks really works and gives that internal reward feeling when you do well.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"6"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id463644833"}, "name":{"label":"dugstar2020"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-02-17T00:22:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"7004401444"}, "title":{"label":"Still sticking to New Years resolutions"}, "content":{"label":"It’s still keeping me on track with my New Years goals, which is why I bought it. Lovely interface, works well on watch too!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id181819350"}, "name":{"label":"jusuju"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-06-18T11:24:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.3.5"}, "id":{"label":"6092744357"}, "title":{"label":"Too simplified"}, "content":{"label":"Very simple - which can be a plus. BUT... impossible to change previous day record ( in my case it was the amount of sugar in my diet, which I only check next day). The habits descriptors are not linked to the Ihealth app ( same example with sugar- it’s calculated in I health, but not passed to steakes). They are not even linked to a compatible streak workout. So, when I complete it the habit descriptor is not checked out. I can describe many similar examples. So, it’s more like check list. You can get a free app for this. But if you paid almost 10 backs for a bundle - you should expect more functionality.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
