{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id187693844"}, "name":{"label":"Vyvy101"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-24T10:41:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1596711024"}, "title":{"label":"Love it for personal development!"}, "content":{"label":"Really love this app. I have tried many times to make little improvements in my life but always aimed for too many changes at once, got overwhelmed and gave up. With this, you can pick a max of 6 at a time which keeps it achievable. I've been trying to get over a relationship and look after myself better in the process and this app helps keeps me on track each day!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id105003542"}, "name":{"label":"jayb88"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-06-19T03:18:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"1396941810"}, "title":{"label":"Easy to use and clever"}, "content":{"label":"Streaks is an easy to use habit tracker that works with you to help you build the habits you want. When setting up a new habit you can choose from presents, some of which feed into the Health app, or create your own, in that case Streaks will look at the habit name and try to find an appropriate icon. It's a small thing that saves you some time.\n\nIt has all the features you want from a habit tracker except for support for habits that require multiple action in a day, like drinking water. Then again none of the trackers I've tried have that. Highly recommended.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/reviews/id37113160"}, "name":{"label":"BrianMcGee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-06-04T01:15:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.2"}, "id":{"label":"1388706809"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent"}, "content":{"label":"If you want to form a habit of any kind, download this app. Yes it's restricted to six, but I think this is a good thing, it focuses the mind to choose the most important items. Love it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ie/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
